  (:adr/id "adr-2607221000-cloud-itonami-jsic-4113-animeka-occupation-layer")
  (:adr/title "ADR-2607221000: cloud-itonami — JSIC 4113(アニメーション制作業)actor追加、animeka職能層のISCO-2166/ISIC-5911衝突の解消")
